	StaticText "full brightness. Applies to monsters, barrels,", "gray"
	StaticText "pickups, and your hands in either mode --", "gray"
	StaticText "world actors and view-model hands take the", "gray"
	StaticText "same exemption, so toggling between them does", "gray"
